if you're thinking of starting a new  business make sure it's around something  that you love doing and you know will  help a lot of people  otherwise you're going to end up  failing  broke and having to go back and get  another job  hi i'm evan carmichael i believe that  hungry entrepreneurs deserve help and  today i'm answering a question from a  youtube viewer love your youtube guys  mo  and mo wrote in to say evan if you're  not good at anything in particular but  you know in your heart you want to own  your own business how do you figure out  exactly what to go for if you don't have  a talent to capitalize on  great question mo thanks for asking it  and i believe that everybody has  talent and skills and passion for  something you just have to tap into it  if you're not sure what you want to do  yet  my recommendation is to go out  and make a list of all the things that  you love doing and that helps people if  you want to have success as an  entrepreneur you've got to love your  business you've got to do it even if  you're not getting paid to do it you've  got to run through brick walls because  it's going to be hard  and it has to help people  people have to have a problem that you  are solving for them  if you can merge those two something  that you love doing with something that  helps a lot of people in a really great  way  that is the core of a successful  business that you can start  if you are you know still planning that  out that's fine it's an exciting place  to be it's a great time to be writing in  and asking questions  start talking to potential customers see  what their feedback is  see how you can help them  and if you've never started a business  before  before going out and launching your own  what i would recommend is go work for  somebody else  go find somebody who's doing exactly  what you're doing  somebody who has experience who's built  up their business to five or ten  employees  somebody who you respect go work for  them learn the business learn the  industry learn what it takes to be an  entrepreneur you'll make all your  mistakes while getting paid to do it  you'll make industry contacts you'll  learn how that company operates and when  you go launch your own business you'll  have a lot of the things lined up where  most entrepreneurs  don't do that and end up failing  but right where you are if you're trying  to figure out what your passion is  start by thinking about the things that  you can get lost in things that you  could do all day long you wake up you're  excited to do it it's eight in the  morning  you're working away  you look up and it's five o'clock at  night you've gotten lost in it you love  doing it so much  and then think about how that could help  people  for me  i love helping entrepreneurs and i love  researching  famous entrepreneurs stories and how  they got started if i'm reading a  biography or the story of  of how some entrepreneur got started i  can get lost in it i can spend hours  doing it and and realize oh my god i  just lost so much time doing this i got  to get back to work  so turn that into work when i'm helping  entrepreneurs i often lose track of time  because i'm helping them i love helping  them it brings me so much happiness and  i might overrun some other things that i  was supposed to do  that's when you know you found something  that you're excited about  apply that plus the ability to help  people and you are on your way to making  a successful business  good luck write back to me when you  figured it out and we can help you get  to the next step for all that you  watching if you like the video please  give it a thumbs up below and hey i want  to hear from you too please leave a  comment below it really makes my day  when i see those come in if you have a  comment about this video or question for  your own business leave it below and i  will write back thank you guys i'll see  you soon
 

